---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="diceforce IT | IT Consulting & Staffing Services | Hire Smarter. Scale Faster." 
	description="From Prompt Chaining, Fine-Tuning, RAG, to Azure AI Foundry, we help businesses accelerate product delivery with flexible IT staffing & consulting."
	activePage="it-staffing"
>
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-16 md:gap-24">
		
		<!-- SECTION 1: HERO HEADER -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20 backdrop-blur-md">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase font-semibold">IT CONSULTING & STAFFING SERVICES</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="font-syne font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tighter leading-[0.95] text-white select-text text-balance">
					Hire Smarter.<br />
					<span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-500 to-purple-500">Scale Faster.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-neutral-300 font-light text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mt-6 leading-relaxed select-text">
					From Prompt Chaining, Fine-Tuning, RAG-powered knowledge assistants, to Azure AI Foundry deployments, we help organizations build AI solutions that are accurate, secure, and aligned with business goals. As a trusted IT consultant company, we help businesses accelerate product delivery and optimize engineering efficiency through highly flexible staffing and consulting models designed for modern organizations.
				</p>
				<div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="/contact" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-600 text-black font-extrabold rounded-full hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.4)] hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
						Talk to Our Consultants
					</a>
					<a href="#offerings" class="px-7 py-3.5 border border-white/15 hover:border-cyan-400/40 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
						Let’s Brainstorm
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Hero Right: Interactive 3D WebGL Particle System (Careers Page Style) -->
			<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative w-full h-[350px] sm:h-[420px] lg:h-[480px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#00deff]/[0.03] blur-[90px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
				<!-- Three.js Canvas Container -->
				<div id="canvas-container" class="w-full h-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing relative z-10"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 2: OUR OFFERINGS -->
		<section id="offerings" class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.02] to-white/[0.005] border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
				<div class="absolute -right-32 -bottom-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>
				
				<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 relative z-10">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
						<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">OUR OFFERINGS</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="font-syne font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight select-text">
						Engineering Talent That Delivers More Than Just Resumes
					</h2>
					<p class="text-neutral-300 text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						DiceForce IT delivers IT staffing services and consulting expertise that go far beyond conventional recruitment. We supply highly skilled software engineers having expertise in LLMs, Prompt Chaining, RAG, Fine-Tuning, Azure AI Foundry, Amazon Lex, Predictive AI, Modular Architecture, Microservices, DevOps, Cloud Platforms, and Enterprise AI Engineering to meet your long-term business objectives.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 3: ENGINEERING-FIRST VETTING FRAMEWORK -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">3-STEP VALIDATION</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="font-syne font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight select-text">
					Our Engineering-First Vetting Framework
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-4xl select-text font-light">
					Before a consultant's profile appears in your email, they must pass a three-step validation procedure that tests their practical application rather than simply their academic expertise. We assess proficiency in Prompt Engineering, Prompt Chaining, RAG implementation, Fine-Tuning methods, LLM orchestration, Azure AI Foundry, and corporate AI architecture for AI-focused positions to make sure consultants can effectively create intelligent systems that are ready for production.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- 3 Steps Grid -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				<!-- Step 1 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500"></div>
					<div>
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
							01
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-xl mb-3 select-text">
							1. System Design & Architecture Audits
						</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We move beyond basic syntax testing to see how engineers solve problems under tight constraints. Our method determines if a candidate can design durable, decoupled microservices and create data pipelines that grow without driving up cloud expenses.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Step 2 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-blue-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500"></div>
					<div>
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-400/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
							02
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-xl mb-3 select-text">
							2. Production-Grade Code Quality
						</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							We look closely at how developers structure, comment, and test their pull requests. We only work with developers who prioritize readability and thorough automated testing, making sure they don't leave behind technical responsibilities and instead build manageable software.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Step 3 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-purple-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500"></div>
					<div>
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-400/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-lg mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
							03
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-xl mb-3 select-text">
							3. Communication & Team Dynamics
						</h3>
						<p class="text-neutral-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							Raw technical capability matters little if an engineer isolates themselves from the squad. We actively evaluate how candidates defend architectural trade-offs, navigate constructive code reviews, and adapt to the rapid velocity of modern sprint cycles.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 4: ARCHITECTING AI & AGENTIC ENGINEERING TEAMS -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
				<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
						<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">ENTERPRISE CAPABILITIES</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="font-syne font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight select-text">
						Architecting AI & Agentic Engineering Teams
					</h2>
					<div class="space-y-4 text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						<p>
							Unlike generic IT staffing companies relying on simple keyword-matching, our IT consulting business hand-vets talent through live system-design audits. Whether you need engineers to deploy autonomous AI agents, develop RAG-powered knowledge assistants, implement Prompt Chaining, optimize Fine-Tuned LLMs, or deploy enterprise AI solutions through Azure AI Foundry, our consultants have the expertise to meet your expectations.
						</p>
						<p>
							As a hands-on IT consultant company, we align with your roadmap through elastic models. We offer temporary staffing to spin up rapid AI pilots, permanent staffing to anchor your core platform teams, and temp-to-hire staffing to evaluate developer code quality in live production. By pairing strategic IT consulting services with elite technical placement, we scale your intelligent infrastructure without generating technical debt.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
					<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 space-y-2 text-center hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-cyan-400">100%</div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-neutral-400 tracking-wider">Hand-Vetted Talent</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 space-y-2 text-center hover:border-blue-400/30 transition-colors">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-blue-400">Zero</div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-neutral-400 tracking-wider">Technical Debt</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 space-y-2 text-center hover:border-purple-400/30 transition-colors">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-purple-400">Elastic</div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-neutral-400 tracking-wider">Staffing Models</div>
					</div>
					<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 space-y-2 text-center hover:border-green-400/30 transition-colors">
						<div class="text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-green-400">72-Hr</div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-neutral-400 tracking-wider">Rapid Integration</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 5: FEATURED SERVICES & SOLUTION CARDS -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">CORE SOLUTIONS</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="font-syne font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight select-text">
					Specialized IT Consulting & Staffing Solutions
				</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
				<!-- Service Card 1 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950/30 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full uppercase">Strategic Direction</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-2xl select-text">IT Consulting Services</h3>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Strategic Engineering Direction Meets Hands-On Execution</div>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							Stop treating infrastructure decisions as simple overhead. As an active IT consulting business, we partner with your leadership to navigate complex legacy migrations. We operate as a hands-on IT consultant company to help you clear persistent technical debt, implement secure CI/CD pipelines, and establish sustainable platform engineering standards.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">IT Consulting Services</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Technical Advisory</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Platform Engineering</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Service Card 2 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-blue-400/40 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-blue-400 bg-blue-950/30 px-3 py-1 border border-blue-500/20 rounded-full uppercase">Permanent Staffing</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-2xl select-text">Core Team Acquisition</h3>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-300 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Targeted Permanent Staffing Solutions</div>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							Through our targeted permanent staffing solutions, we skip the keyword scanners and hand-vet senior talent who naturally align with your tech stack and engineering culture. We help you secure the core software developers, AI engineers, DevOps specialists, and team leads who drive continuous product evolution.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Permanent Staffing</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Engineering Culture</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Core Hiring</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Service Card 3 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-purple-400/40 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-purple-400 bg-purple-950/30 px-3 py-1 border border-purple-500/20 rounded-full uppercase">Trial-To-Hire</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-purple-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-2xl select-text">Strategic Trial-to-Hire</h3>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-300 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Risk-Free Production Evaluation</div>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							Eliminate the risk of bad hires by working with candidates in your actual codebase. Our temp-to-hire staffing model lets you assess an engineer's system design capabilities before extending a permanent offer. It’s the most secure way to scale your division without disrupting delivery velocity.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Temp-to-Hire Staffing</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Code Evaluation</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Risk Mitigation</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Service Card 4 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-emerald-400/40 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group shadow-xl">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/30 px-3 py-1 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-full uppercase">Architecture & Advisory</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-emerald-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-bold text-white text-2xl select-text">Tech Advisory & Architecture Design</h3>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-300 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Practical Migration Plans & Codebase Optimization</div>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							Real-world traffic rarely survives theoretical system designs. As a hands-on IT consulting firm, we delve into your repositories to identify delivery bottlenecks, clear up cluttered codebases, and provide practical migration plans. We partner with your engineering leaders as an active IT consultant company to systematically chip away at technical debt, spin up hardened cloud infrastructure, and deploy automated release pipelines built for long-term stability.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">IT Consulting Services</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Architecture Audit</span>
						<span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">Platform Design</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 6: STAFFING MODELS DEEP-DIVE (Interactive Tabs & Cards) -->
		<section id="staffing-models" class="border-t border-white/5 pt-16 scroll-mt-24 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">FLEXIBLE ENGAGEMENT</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="font-syne font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight select-text">
					Tailored Staffing Models
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light select-text">
					Choose the engagement framework that best fits your sprint velocity, budget cycles, and long-term scaling strategy.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Interactive Tab Buttons -->
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8 border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
				<button 
					id="tab-btn-temp" 
					class="staffing-tab-btn px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-all border border-cyan-400 bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,211,238,0.2)]"
					onclick="switchStaffingTab('temp')"
				>
					Temporary Staffing
				</button>
				<button 
					id="tab-btn-perm" 
					class="staffing-tab-btn px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-all border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30"
					onclick="switchStaffingTab('perm')"
				>
					Permanent Staffing
				</button>
				<button 
					id="tab-btn-t2h" 
					class="staffing-tab-btn px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-all border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30"
					onclick="switchStaffingTab('t2h')"
				>
					Temp-to-Hire Staffing
				</button>
			</div>

			<!-- Tab 1: Temporary Staffing Panel -->
			<div id="tab-panel-temp" class="staffing-tab-panel space-y-8">
				<div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-4">
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
						<div>
